Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.32,0:00:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Shri-Bam, Fwoosh, Grip,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.64,0:00:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Fwoosh,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.54,0:00:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Grip.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.45,0:00:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Grip, Grip.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.37,0:00:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What the horror?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.20,0:00:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Jotaro, Kujo, and Hermes\Nmade it at the last second.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.42,0:00:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,This game is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.82,0:00:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have any more\Nallies to help you,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.04,0:00:37.81,Default,,0,0,0,,and you won't ever be\Nable to see the new moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.00,0:00:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That's where you're wrong, Emporio.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.06,0:00:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It appears that fate is\Ntruly on my side and is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.34,0:00:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,serving me with one last\Ntest to prove my worthiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.82,0:00:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Do it, Hermes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.30,0:00:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Pick up that gun and take the shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.58,0:00:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Seamoon!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.90,0:01:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.92,0:01:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Start Platinum the World.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.48,0:01:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Hoorah!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.48,0:01:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,When time goes back to normal, that\Nspear will fly straight through you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.92,0:01:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.34,0:01:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The spear missed its mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.40,0:01:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,He moved slightly during\Nthe time stop. It failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.08,0:01:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Poochie's still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.26,0:01:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and now this thing is\Nstarting to float in the air too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.72,0:01:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The priest is taking shelter in the\Ngoddamn displaced space shuttle.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.34,0:01:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.72,0:01:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think he's just\Ntrying to get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.82,0:01:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.22,0:01:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Could he have discovered something\Nthat's giving him the advantage?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.02,0:01:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he actually find the missing\Nelement to complete his ability?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.84,0:01:59.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You are the ones who have been\Nhelping to raise me up all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.10,0:02:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since you were in prison, you\Nhave been there, lending me aid.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.12,0:02:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Our Father who art in heaven, I\Nbeseech you to lead and guide me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.78,0:02:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I ask you to please watch over me, so\NI may not walk down the wrong path.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.30,0:02:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It is to your very will that\NI shall dedicate myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.70,0:02:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I can feel it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.42,0:02:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The coordinates!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.24,0:02:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.72,0:02:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.30,0:03:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hikari chin, kumi ni chika.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.70,0:03:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Getting to
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.60,0:03:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Ikiru imi wo Zekai ni nokosu kana
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.20,0:03:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Nozomi wo kudake. Kong no kari no.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.00,0:03:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Destiny is mine, Oso ne\Nshite mo. All of the future,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.46,0:03:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,as I can see,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.70,0:03:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I will shine on the light of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.10,0:04:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,to those who share the\Nblood of the Drostars!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.54,0:04:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.45,0:04:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Anastasia!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.54,0:04:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,He's already managed to get on the\Nouter wall of the space shuttle!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.40,0:04:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You're done for!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.66,0:04:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Now dive or drive!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.06,0:04:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,My stand is Seamoon no longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.62,0:04:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The time for heaven has arrived at last.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.46,0:04:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It has completed!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.60,0:04:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The gravitational power is\Ncoursing through my entire body!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.96,0:04:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Go to hell, you asshole!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.64,0:04:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Heaven doesn't need you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.10,0:05:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Good afternoon, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.04,0:05:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The accident on State Highway\N405 in Cape Canaveral,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.22,0:05:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,with casualty numbers estimated\Nto be between 1 and 2,000,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.28,0:05:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,was initially thought to\Nbe caused by a collapse.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.92,0:05:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.83,0:05:43.33,Default,,0,0,0,,since military vehicles have been\Nunable to approach the scene,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.42,0:05:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,the situation seems to\Nbe much more complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.50,0:05:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,More updates on this\Nstory after the break.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.70,0:05:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,This place is...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.60,0:05:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.92,0:05:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Anastasia!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.98,0:06:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.52,0:06:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.28,0:06:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you worried about me, Jolene?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.32,0:06:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,i'm glad you care it means a lot but more
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.26,0:06:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,importantly that damn\Npriest got away he was
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.52,0:06:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,engulfed in light and\Nthen disappeared we've
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.04,0:06:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,gotta hurry and find that\Nspace shuttle right now
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.28,0:06:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,we don't have to look\Nfar it wasn't the shuttle
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.64,0:06:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,that moved i think it was us it seems that
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.70,0:06:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,we shifted about 200 meters away from it i
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.74,0:06:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,have no idea how but we\Nwere just behind that
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.22,0:06:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Building a moment ago.\NWell, I don't mean to.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.86,0:06:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,be rude Jotaro but I\Nthink I'd remember if I
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.48,0:06:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,were blown away or\Nwhatever yeah did no one
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.20,0:06:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,else see anything like\Nthat my guess is that we
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.02,0:06:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,were moved by the reverse\Ngravity good theory
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.50,0:06:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,but not likely the gravitational effect is
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.22,0:06:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,already worn off back\Nthere and besides the
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.14,0:06:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,priest said that sea moon\Nwas no longer his stand
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.74,0:06:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Charlene where is he can you sense which\Nway the priest is headed I can sense that
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.62,0:07:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,He's still here, although that's about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.48,0:07:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,so we don't know where he's hiding or what
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.66,0:07:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,direction he's going only that he's around
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.28,0:07:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,and besides that he\Ndefinitely saw the spear
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.78,0:07:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,coming when Star Platinum sent it flying
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.52,0:07:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,towards his face even\Nwhile time was stopped
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.48,0:07:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,in that split second he managed to dodge\Nbecause he could see but how'd he do it
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.22,0:07:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, I get it now. The priest\Nwas all like, "It's been
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.98,0:07:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,completed and the time for\Nheaven has arrived and all
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.72,0:07:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,that shit but what if he\Nwas just feeding us a lie
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.22,0:07:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,and he was actually bluffing\Nso he could buy some time
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.52,0:07:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,for himself and hide away\Nuntil the new moon tomorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.38,0:07:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,i say he's full of it i\Nbet he's just trying to get
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.50,0:07:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,away hermes i'd advise\Nagainst going in that building
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.52,0:07:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay in an open area. The\Nrain will soon let up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.12,0:08:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We're soaked!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.96,0:08:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on, you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.90,0:08:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Hermes!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.76,0:08:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.32,0:08:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah, it's this automatic door!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.08,0:08:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.99,0:08:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.16,0:08:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.86,0:08:36.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Why does this thing\Nshut like a guillotine?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.62,0:08:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Already dry, but I was just soaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.04,0:08:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,No, what the fuck is happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.52,0:08:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Be more careful, Hermes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.50,0:08:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.28,0:08:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time for the evening news.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.12,0:09:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We have continued reports on the Cape\NCanaveral catastrophe on Highway 405.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.00,0:09:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, uh, actually, my apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.80,0:09:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll now be going to commercial.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.48,0:09:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.12,0:09:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's already over?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.78,0:09:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The sun's setting? Already?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.24,0:09:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, I'll have chocolate nuts and caramel\Nand strawberry chocolate chip and mint.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.42,0:09:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, and orange vanilla, too, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.16,0:09:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.07,0:09:34.15,Default,,0,0,0,,That'll be six dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.94,0:09:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.12,0:09:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.30,0:09:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got one amazing rookie here, folks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.98,0:09:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like he's gonna be the MVP!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.22,0:09:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I am amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.02,0:10:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.93,0:10:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I-It's hardened!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.78,0:10:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch! That hurts! Help, Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.80,0:10:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Barry!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.16,0:10:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Go get 20 kilos of meat\Nfrom the freezer! Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.36,0:10:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.00,0:10:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,He finally hit it, but it's a puff-fly!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.34,0:10:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,W-What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.00,0:10:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,He's bleeding from gusely!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.66,0:10:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It all happened in the blink of an eye!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.80,0:10:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.34,0:10:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The speed we're coming into\Nland with is way too high!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.94,0:10:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but all the radios\Nseem to be normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.40,0:10:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad! Pull off!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.18,0:11:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.58,0:11:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The hell is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.54,0:11:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hermit!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.74,0:11:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess he wasn't bluffing after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.04,0:11:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.36,0:11:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Turns out that bastard wasn't trying to\Nplay a trick so he could get away from us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.62,0:11:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,And plus, there's my blood, even though\Nthe wound is fresh and still bleeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.72,0:11:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's already dried,\Nway faster than normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.70,0:11:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The blood's drying, instantly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.34,0:11:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene, the blood on your\Nface too, it's dried up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.86,0:11:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And it looks like it's already\Ncrumbling away. Yeah, true.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.82,0:11:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,But what does that mean, and why?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.18,0:11:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.78,0:11:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys, he really was telling the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.42,0:11:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,The priest's new ability—he\Nalready had it back on the shuttle!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.38,0:11:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,And now everything is\Nmoving at a faster speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.98,0:11:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything in this world is...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.54,0:12:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,And I don't just mean the machines,\NI'm talking literally everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.08,0:12:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh shit, the sun's already gone down,\Nand the stars are lighting up the sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.42,0:12:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Does that mean the\Ncompletion of his ability?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.64,0:12:24.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.55,0:12:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.82,0:12:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,So then, this is what the\NPriest's new ability can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.48,0:12:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.58,0:12:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The way the stars and clouds are moving,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.58,0:12:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,they look like special\Neffects from a movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.64,0:12:39.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What exactly is this\Nnew ability capable of?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.46,0:12:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not the only thing. It's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.62,0:12:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It's speeding up as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.62,0:12:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The passage of time is\Ngoing by faster and faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.88,0:12:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,And under these circumstances,\Nit seems only he's safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.32,0:12:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Could he be the only one who can\Nwithstand the rapid acceleration of time?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.24,0:12:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's highly possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.84,0:13:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,He was able to avoid the\Nspear I threw at him,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.34,0:13:05.69,Default,,0,0,0,,though it might have been unconsciously.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.12,0:13:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,However, if he is capable of moving\Nunder this rapid passing of time,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.32,0:13:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,and if he's come to realize\Nthat he can still move around...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.74,0:13:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene, we're leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.88,0:13:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We aren't safe here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.86,0:13:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Staying out here any longer isn't wise.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.00,0:13:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.14,0:13:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you sense it as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.54,0:13:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene, do you feel his presence?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.30,0:13:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but where?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.84,0:13:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,He keeps moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.30,0:13:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And the bastard's hiding himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.52,0:13:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,So I can't tell where he's\Nat, but he's coming closer!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.26,0:13:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.68,0:13:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's move.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.22,0:13:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Start running.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.40,0:13:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, everyone, get a move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.24,0:13:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Star Platinum, the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.20,0:14:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,My time stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.68,0:14:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It was drastically shortened. Ah, shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.86,0:14:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,This way, Mr. Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.00,0:14:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.91,0:14:19.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You're Anastasia, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.78,0:14:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.69,0:14:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,My stand is Diver Drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.00,0:14:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It can embed itself into anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.36,0:14:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's watch the other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.64,0:14:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but the thing is so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.76,0:14:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think just being on\Nthe lookout will do much.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.68,0:14:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.92,0:14:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Jotaro,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.98,0:14:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm determined to protect your\Ndaughter with everything I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.54,0:14:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We've already got ourselves caught\Nup in something we can't back out of.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.98,0:14:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,but we will make it out alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.18,0:14:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'd like to ask you for your\Nblessing to marry your daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.64,0:14:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what did you just say to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.34,0:14:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I asked you for your blessing. Please, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.18,0:15:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, respectfully, I\Nwant to marry your daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.52,0:15:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I know now's not the best time, but all\Nyou have to do is give me your permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.50,0:15:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,If I may have her father's approval, it'd\Nmean more to me than you'll ever know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.50,0:15:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't expect it to be easy,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.40,0:15:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,and it's not like I've always felt\Nworthy enough to marry Jolene.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.24,0:15:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,And sure, I have been branded a murderer,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.74,0:15:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,so I'm well aware that there's no way Jolene\Nwould fall in love with me right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.40,0:15:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,But the sheer determination and pure\Nsoul which Jolene inherited from you,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.98,0:15:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,her father,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.89,0:15:37.35,Default,,0,0,0,,is the light that shines upon\Nthe darkest part of my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.90,0:15:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's that heart that\Ncould collapse at any moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.12,0:15:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,She is exactly what I need.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.52,0:15:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Just say yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.34,0:15:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.90,0:15:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That word is all I need to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.38,0:15:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I need you to let me marry her\Nwhen we make it out of this alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.12,0:16:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what you're talking about.\NAre you insane? Look where we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.64,0:16:05.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Anastasia
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.78,0:16:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to stay together all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.88,0:16:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's not scatter.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.74,0:16:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, we made it to this\Nroof and we're fine for now,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.10,0:16:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,but there's no escape\NPoochie still on the move.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.96,0:16:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I've set up a barrier\Naround us with my strings,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.16,0:16:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,but who knows if this will even work.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.96,0:16:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,And since he was able\Nto complete his ability,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.64,0:16:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,he's not just going to\Nlet us get away scot-free.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.66,0:16:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,No, he wants to see\Nthis through to the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.80,0:16:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Because he knows that he's\Ngoing to have to kill us and
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.48,0:16:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,put an end to the Joestar\Nbloodline once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.30,0:16:47.77,Default,,0,0,0,,But still, we have no idea what he can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.98,0:16:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,How the hell are we supposed\Nto fight against that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.56,0:16:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.47,0:16:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, say yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.86,0:17:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.77,0:17:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,All of you, listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.70,0:17:08.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It may seem like we've been\Ncornered up here, but getting on
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.92,0:17:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,the roof was the right decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.32,0:17:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,His new ability is to speed up\Ntime, and he's the only person
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.58,0:17:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,who can move through it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.74,0:17:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,But it doesn't mean that\Nwe can't see him at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.82,0:17:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,According to the speed at which\Nthe hands of my watch are moving,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.72,0:17:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,the minute hand indicates that
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.76,0:17:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,it takes about two minutes\Nfor a full hour to go by.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.52,0:17:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.72,0:17:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,someone running at ten\Nkilometers per hour would
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.72,0:17:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,seem to us as if they were\Nrunning at the same speed
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.42,0:17:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,as a bullet train.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.33,0:17:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,However, we are still able to see\Nan approaching bullet train with our
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.22,0:17:40.05,Default,,0,0,0,,naked eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.13,0:17:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay calm and observe.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.64,0:17:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We can at least see his moves.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.38,0:17:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Try to sense where he's going next.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.58,0:17:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.72,0:17:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That means if a car is\Ngoing 60 kilometers per hour
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.42,0:17:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,it would feel like 1800 and\Na hundred will be Mach 2.4
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.32,0:17:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,exactly but lucky for us the\Npriest is still reluctant
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.42,0:18:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,to climb up here and join\Nus on this roof he's being
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.64,0:18:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,cautious because of me and\Nmy ability to stop time for
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.86,0:18:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,several seconds and there's\Nstill something that none of
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.82,0:18:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,us know how will his ability\Nevolve from this point on
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.62,0:18:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure the priest wants to\Nlearn his Stan's true worth.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.20,0:18:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Star Platinum! The world!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.40,0:18:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.66,0:18:33.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did that bastard go?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.46,0:18:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Something moves underneath that table.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.54,0:18:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,He has to be around here somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.08,0:18:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The longest I can stop time\Nis five seconds at most.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.60,0:18:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to locate him and strike him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.80,0:18:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,All in the span of five seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.82,0:18:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Good grief. He's not there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.62,0:18:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I must have been imagining\Nsomething moving down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.40,0:18:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.08,0:18:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Now time will resume.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.16,0:19:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That's where he's hiding.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.56,0:19:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,In a palm tree! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.92,0:19:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.12,0:19:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,He's using it as a spring!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.86,0:19:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the limit!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.02,0:19:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Time will resume!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.20,0:19:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gonna launch himself off the tree!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.48,0:19:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,He's there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.78,0:19:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,-ro!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.22,0:19:43.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Put him!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.76,0:19:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Julian, behind you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.56,0:19:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,He's coming back!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.42,0:19:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Anastasia.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.80,0:19:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You just used your stand
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.00,0:20:02.41,Default,,0,0,0,,and dove into my body at the last second.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.38,0:20:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,In that moment, you let your\Nstand take the brunt of the attack
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.80,0:20:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,so that I wouldn't have\Nto suffer a fatal wound.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.30,0:20:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But still.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.08,0:20:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's still too short.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.16,0:20:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Stopping time for just\Nfive seconds isn't enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.86,0:20:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm not able to\Nstop time consecutively.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.18,0:20:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,After I stop time for five\Nseconds using Star Platinum,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.62,0:20:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to take a moment\Nto catch my breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.90,0:20:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the only way that I\Ncan stop time again so soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.46,0:20:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,But now that the priest has\Nreached his full potential,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.14,0:20:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,the only one who can\Nstand up to him is me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.62,0:20:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,When he's in close enough range,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.60,0:20:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,the only chance I've got to take him out\Nis right now while time is still stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.88,0:20:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.30,0:21:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Time will resume once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.72,0:21:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no! Old man! Anastasia!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.78,0:21:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose the one who will be first in\Nline to die will be Anastasia instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.60,0:21:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,And not Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.38,0:21:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,But you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.14,0:21:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Although it's something so vast\Nyou will not be able to fathom it,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.48,0:21:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I will make this clear once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.54,0:21:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Time will keep racing by.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.22,0:21:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,But for your clarification,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.22,0:21:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I did not obtain this ability just\Nso I could dispose of you all,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.64,0:21:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,nor did I do it to\Nbecome the most powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.56,0:21:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The true purpose of this\Nability is to guide the
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.20,0:21:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,masses of humanity towards\Neverlasting happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.78,0:22:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Allow me to introduce you to my\Nnew stand, my gift to humanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.30,0:22:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall christen my stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.20,0:22:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Made in heaven!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.20,0:22:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,is filled with hope of
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.02,0:22:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,some place other than here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.20,0:22:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Although you think I smile
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.20,0:22:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,inside and all the while,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.08,0:23:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm wondering about my destiny
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.00,0:23:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm thinking
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.00,0:23:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,about all
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.20,0:23:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,the things I'd like to do
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.44,0:23:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,In my life
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.46,0:23:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a dreamer
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.70,0:23:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,A distant dreamer
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.38,0:23:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Dreaming far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.76,0:23:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,From today
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.26,0:24:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You. Thank you.
